msgid "This page’s own questions"
msgstr ""

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2757
msgid "This pairing code has already been used by another site. Issue a new one from the dashboard."
msgstr "ລະຫັດຈັບຄູ່ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍເວັບໄຊອື່ນແລ້ວ. ອອກລະຫັດໃໝ່ຈາກແດຊບອດ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2837
msgid "This site has no public domain to register. A license can only be activated on a publicly reachable site."
msgstr "ເວັບໄຊນີ້ບໍ່ມີໂດເມນສາທາລະນະໃຫ້ລົງທະບຽນ. ລິຂະສິດສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເວັບໄຊທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສາທາລະນະ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3330
msgid "This site is already registered. Regenerate the key with an administrator token if the existing key is unavailable."
msgstr "ເວັບໄຊນີ້ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ. ສ້າງກະແຈໃໝ່ດ້ວຍໂທເຄັນຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ ຖ້າກະແຈທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້."

